==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Zyclone]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.

